/target
Cargo.lock

# Kiro local workspace state (tool-specific). The canonical specs live in
# docs/specs/ and are committed. Keep the steering pointer so a fresh clone
# still wires Kiro to the shared source of truth.
#
# NOTE: git cannot re-include a file if a PARENT directory is excluded, so we
# ignore the *contents* of .kiro (/.kiro/*) rather than the directory itself,
# then re-include the steering directory and its pointer file step by step.
/.kiro/*
!/.kiro/steering/
/.kiro/steering/*
!/.kiro/steering/specs.md
